# Catalyst Connect — Product Owner Constitution (FROZEN)

**Catalyst Connect** = Wealth Partner App.  
**Catalyst One** = Enterprise Operating System · **SSOT**.

## Final Product Principle (Frozen)

Catalyst Connect must **never** duplicate business logic, customer onboarding flows, product configuration, or document rules.

It is a **simplified presentation layer** that inherits product definitions, validations, recommendations, and document requirements from Catalyst One.

The only difference between the two platforms is **permissions — not process**.

## Hard rules

1. **SSOT** — Every product / borrower journey consumes Catalyst One **Initial Data Collection** config (forms, fields, order, mandatory, validations, help text, defaults, conditional visibility, recommendations, LOD, opportunity workflow). No parallel Connect loan forms or rules.
2. **No independent fields** — Never hardcode PAN, Company Name, DOB, or any field unless Catalyst One Initial Data Collection config exposes it.
3. **Journey sync** — Product → Borrower Type → Dynamic Initial Data → Product Questions → Recommendations → Required Documents → Upload → Opportunity Creation. Post-create credit/lender/internal ops stay **Catalyst One only** — never expose to Wealth Partners.
4. **Documents** — LOD from Catalyst One only. Simple Upload + status. No partner-driven categorization / folders.
5. **Source attribution (Frozen)** — Source is **never editable / never shown**. Auto-derive from authenticated Wealth Partner (partner id, name, type, org, branch/territory, hierarchy).
6. **System-derived** — Never ask for Source, Partner ID/Name, Org, Branch, Territory, RM, Commission, Role, Permissions. Partner enters **customer** information only.
7. **Digital Visiting Card** — Primary header shortcut (beside Profile) + Profile access. Content/branding from Catalyst One.
8. **Enterprise design** — Connect = guided acquisition. One = enterprise engines (policy, workflow, credit, documents, ops).
9. **Recommendations (CO-WP-REC-001)** — After IDC, invoke Catalyst One Recommendation Engine via Partner Gateway. Display customer-friendly cards only. Never recalculate in Connect. Never expose Credit Workbench, Credit Score, Risk Engine, Policy Engine, or internal lender scoring.
10. **List of Documents (CO-WP-LOD-001)** — LOD from Catalyst One EDIE only (product · borrower · recommendation context · enterprise product config). Simple Upload / Replace / Preview / Status / Missing. Never partner-chosen categories or Connect-local checklists.

