## Agent behaviour

- Do **not** invent Connect-local masters, LODs, recommendation formulas, or business rules.
- Prefer Partner Gateway DTOs / journey config APIs from Catalyst One.
- New Connect UI must remain a projection of Enterprise configuration.
- Field add/remove/change belongs **only** in Enterprise IDC catalog — never in Wealth Partner App source.
- Recommendation cards/copy belong **only** in Catalyst One presentation constants / engine projection.
